          "encryptedProductId": "a069b30624e4bf79432fff70de1126a0",
          "gender": "여성",
          "goodText": "Appearance and packaging\nEach sheet mask comes individually packed with 25ml of essence.\n\nTexture/viscosity \nThis is a water essence type sheet mask. When I took the mask out it felt very slippery in my hands, but when I put it on it hugged my face and stayed in place very well.\n\nScent\nI could not detect any scent.\n\nMy experience\nI have tried many different sheet masks before, and my sensitive skin reacted to many of them. In some cases it seemed to be due to one or more of the ingredients, and in some cases it may have been because of the sheet itself. I have not been able to test this product as thoroughly as I would like to (yet), but my impression so far is that this is one of the exceptions that my skin accepts well.\n\nI recommend it for…\nThis seems like an all round great choice for anyone who likes sheet masks. It seems to be gentle and suitable for sensitive skin. That said, as always, there may still be people who react to it, or who are allergic to one or more of the ingredients.",
